    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index jumped by 1,320 points week-on-week to the highest level since 2009 at 14,430. Substantial weekly increases of $7,000/day and $10,600/day lifted the round-voyage and fronthaul rates to $38,000/day and $63,850/day, respectively.",
